                                "example_id": "521e5776-9253-493d-bb78-3d5245453c2c",
                                "sense_id": "c232e00a-0d3a-382c-b0f9-5fa2824a14e4",
                                "text": "Кому́ она́ пода́ст стака́н, тот сейча́с вино́ вы́пьет и на подно́с, ско́лько чу́вствует усе́рдия, де́нег ме́чет, зо́лото и́ли ассигна́ции; а она́ его́ тогда́ в уста́ поцелу́ет и покло́нится.",
                                "translation": "Whoever she offered a glass to drank the wine at once and flung money on the tray, gold or banknotes, as much as his zeal prompted him to; and she would then kiss him on the lips and bow to him.",
                                "english": "Whoever she offered a glass to drank the wine at once and flung money on the tray, gold or banknotes, as much as his zeal prompted him to; and she would then kiss him on the lips and bow to him."
                            }
                        ]
